        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9587-60, Surface Mounted Flush Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-3/8\" by 1-7/8\" surface mounted Ring Pull is great for cabinet doors, furniture, or cabinet drawers--anywhere that a ring pull is desired. The Surface Mounted Drop Ring Pull must be mortised (door face cut out) 5/8\" into the doors face. The mortising can be done with a router or small wood chisel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Omnia  9587/60 Surface Mounted Flush Ring Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is being discontinued. Very limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
